{"v":4,"catch":"化身為愛麗絲，再度踏上追逐真相的冒險――","desc":"《扭曲國度的愛麗絲～Recollection》是多元結局型的恐怖小說冒險遊戲。\n\n某一天，我在學校醒來之後，一名自稱「笑臉貓」的謎樣人物這麼對我說……。\n「來吧，我們的愛麗絲，去追白兔吧。」\n\n★從過去的直向畫面變成完全支援橫向畫面的＜新裝版＞扭曲國度的愛麗絲\n★支援觸控操作\n★元老工作人員細心改寫，無損原作\n★為了Recollection版重新編寫背景音樂\n★搭載跳過文字、自動遊戲功能，玩起來更輕鬆\n★「收藏」追加珍藏圖像、影片\n＊Recollection版並未搭載角色專欄，敬請留意。","publisher":"Nightmare STUDIO","release":"2022-08-25","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 0.8GB / Switch 0.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e0b71d4007ffcbc8fe074c1312b39487be1afb04bf05f2a00d2620ec1b9a42b3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e17259785746147e58a4eadb0e3f70fc24f95f3150dba1c96cbb3dea60b26a0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4f81958b5f30c09a212b3489aa867f494e386dbe14d79da97e34a3bfb0afd0fd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1ef3b45b9c88f83bbd66c36ed534f4de21f9522db2c71530a390e03e822529c4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/659d32d507f2cafb5f486910000d55cb2f764d5c6cad0b12ce1655b8b50398e4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/590a202ca02cca60cbb7a3ec12b83c7579dc10ab44cb052fa3bfe8defa89d1ce.jpg"],"titleId":"01007350190c4000","dlc":[]}